Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Web browser developed for os:e8y6
 browser:e8y6 is a Qt 6 and Qt WebEngine-based web browser
 developed for the os:e8y6 operating system.
 .
 It uses system-provided Qt WebEngine libraries and receives
 browser engine updates through operating system packages.
